# TVING

> Korea's leading OTT service streaming live TV, on-demand movies and dramas, original productions, KBO baseball, news, and short-form video.

TVING is operated by CJ ENM. The catalog includes licensed Korean and international films, dramas, variety shows, animation, live general-entertainment and news channels, and exclusive originals. Live KBO (Korea Baseball Organization) broadcasts are a flagship sports offering. Most content is gated behind a subscription (TVING Membership, Double Membership), with selected free tiers and advertising-supported access. Pages are localized in Korean (`ko`) and English (`en`); the URLs below default to Korean.

Dynamic route segments are shown as `[name]` placeholders. Replace them with real values to reach a concrete page — for example, `https://www.tving.com/sports/baseball` or `https://www.tving.com/kbo/team/HT`. For a complete URL listing, see the [sitemap index](https://notice.tving.com/sitemap/sitemap_index.xml).

